      <tr><td><strong>Hi Mountain Jerky Gun</strong></td><td>Plastic-and-metal hybrid</td><td>Sold with Hi Mountain's cure and seasoning kits; includes three interchangeable nozzles (flat, round, long)</td><td>Buyers who want a starter kit with cure included</td></tr>
